  "text": "proprium.pretiosissimi-sanguinis-domini-nostri-iesu-christi-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Most Precious Blood of Our Lord Jesus Christ” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Admitted to the sacred banquet, O Lord, we have drawn water in joy from the Savior’s fountain; may His Blood, we beseech You, become for us a fountain of water springing up unto life everlasting. Who livest and reignest with God the Father in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
